# Ignore raw dataset files — download locally, never commit to Git.
# Patterns here are relative to data/.
# NOTE: files committed before this fix are still tracked; see data/README.md.

balabit/**
sapimouse/**
custom/**

# Keep the README and folder structure
!README.md
!balabit/
!sapimouse/
!custom/
!balabit/.gitkeep
!balabit/README.md
!balabit/public_labels.csv
!sapimouse/.gitkeep
!custom/.gitkeep
